mapping "T848X.1" source="T848X" target="473038008" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source T848X = SNOMED CT 473038008. This is the Swedish unspecified-localization counterpart,
        semantically co-extensive with ICD-10 T84.8 (which Athena-maps to SNOMED CT 43021250, Complication
        associated with orthopedic device). No region detail to lose. High-confidence match: verified
        via the T84.8 crosswalk, exact clinical scope. Mapping type exact_match because the source
